Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.93,OP_JP_EP22,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fs75}They think I’m a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:26.56,OP_JP_EP22,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fs75}I don’t care, I don’t care, I don’t care
