Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:38.19,OP_JP_EP22,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fs75}I’ve got nothing, but this fire
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:42.28,OP_JP_EP22,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fs75}I’ll show you what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:46.09,OP_JP_EP22,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fs75}Watch me, this is me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.85,0:21:46.09,OP_JP_EP22,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(240,240)\fs75}I’m not who I used to be
